From: Salvo Tomaselli <tiposchi@tiscali.it>
Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 08:33:02 +0000
Subject: Proper translation for cowardly

Last-Update: 2017-01-24

Cowardly was inconrrectly translated, depriving the Italian message
of the funny tone that the original has.

This fixes it by properly translating cowardly, without paraphrasing it into
"total refusal".
---
 po/it.po | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/po/it.po b/po/it.po
index 5a6efcd..88a66ef 100644
--- a/po/it.po
+++ b/po/it.po
@@ -2626,7 +2626,7 @@ msgstr ""
 
 #: src/tar.c:2665
 msgid "Cowardly refusing to create an empty archive"
-msgstr "Rifiuto totale di creare un archivio vuoto"
+msgstr "Rifiuto vigliaccamente di creare un archivio vuoto"
 
 #: src/tar.c:2691
 msgid "Options '-Aru' are incompatible with '-f -'"
